{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_013m6KFvKecyrpj3UT9WvsSd", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Joseph_School_of_San_Jose_City,_Nueva_Ecija\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kasaysayansj.com/about/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.vaticannews.va/fr/eglise/news/2021-02/consecration-nationale-philippines-eglise-saint-joseph.print.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://philippines.licas.news/2021/07/04/church-in-baras-rizal-province-declared-diocesan-shrine/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mormonnewsroom-preview.ldschurch.org/ldsnewsroom/eng/news-releases-stories/history-of-the-church-of-jesus-christ-of-latter-day-saints-in-the-visayas\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.rvasia.org/church-asia/philippine-st-joseph-proclaimed-protector-quezon-city\"}, {\"url\": \"https://newspapers.lib.utah.edu/details?id=4117523\"}, {\"url\": \"https://philippines123.com/wiki/Santuario_de_San_Jose\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.filcatholic.org/baras-church-in-rizal-declared-diocesan-shrine/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:46:54.975Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "天主教圣若瑟教区 菲律宾 设立", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01FdQR64pXHTKv5ENhtzb1Ye", "content": [{"title": "St. Joseph School of San Jose City, Nueva Ecija", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Joseph_School_of_San_Jose_City,_Nueva_Ecija"}, {"title": "kasaysayansj.com", "url": "https://kasaysayansj.com/about/"}, {"title": "La Sainte Famille La Sainte Famille", "url": "https://www.vaticannews.va/fr/eglise/news/2021-02/consecration-nationale-philippines-eglise-saint-joseph.print.html"}, {"title": "church in baras rizal province declared diocesan shrine", "url": "https://philippines.licas.news/2021/07/04/church-in-baras-rizal-province-declared-diocesan-shrine/"}, {"title": "Headquarters (USA) Preview Site", "url": "https://mormonnewsroom-preview.ldschurch.org/ldsnewsroom/eng/news-releases-stories/history-of-the-church-of-jesus-christ-of-latter-day-saints-in-the-visayas"}, {"title": "RVA Pope Prayer Request", "url": "https://www.rvasia.org/church-asia/philippine-st-joseph-proclaimed-protector-quezon-city"}, {"title": "newspapers.lib.utah.edu", "url": "https://newspapers.lib.utah.edu/details?id=4117523"}, {"title": "Santuario de San Jose", "url": "https://philippines123.com/wiki/Santuario_de_San_Jose"}, {"title": "baras church in rizal declared diocesan shrine", "url": "https://www.filcatholic.org/baras-church-in-rizal-declared-diocesan-shrine/"}]}, "搜索结果中**没有找到关于\"圣若瑟教区\"（菲律宾）设立时间、经过或教区信息的直接内容**。返回的结果主要是与圣若瑟相关的堂区和圣所，并不是教区本身：\n\n- 巴拉斯（Baras，黎刹省）的圣若瑟堂区在2021年被安提波洛教区主教宣布为教区圣所，但这只是堂区层级的信息。Bishop Francisco de Leon of Antipolo has declared a 17th-century church dedicated to Jesus' foster father as a diocesan shrine.\n- 马尼拉的圣若瑟圣所由奥布拉特圣若瑟会（Oblates of St. Joseph）管理，falls under the jurisdiction of the Archdiocese of Manila。\n- 奎松市的圣若瑟圣所was founded on November 23, 1951，它主要服务于库巴奥教区（Diocese of Cubao）下的天主教徒。\n\n如果您指的是某个以\"San Jose\"（圣若瑟的西班牙语名称）命名的教区，可能需要进一步搜索，例如用\"San Jose diocese Philippines established\"或\"Diocese of San Jose 菲律宾\"等关键词。我个人了解菲律宾有以San Jose命名的教区（如中吕宋的新埃西哈省圣何塞教区），但这一信息未经本次搜索确认，建议核实。"], "durationSeconds": 7.621546542, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_013m6KFvKecyrpj3UT9WvsSd", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
