{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDWkCw4LAujF1ju61teq", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：1984 年。**\n\n“菲律宾圣若瑟教区”一般指新怡诗夏省（Nueva Ecija）的 Diocese of San Jose。1984 年 2 月 16 日，教宗若望保禄二世用诏书 *Saepe Catholicorum Utilitas* 设立这个教区，同年 7 月 14 日正式成立。教区是从甲万那端教区（Cabanatuan）分出来的。\n\n菲律宾还有一个名字相近的教区，容易搞混：安蒂克的圣若瑟教区（San Jose de Antique）。它在 1962 年先设为自治监督区，1982 年才升为教区。如果题目问的是它，答案就是 1962 年或 1982 年。\n\n一共搜了 3 次。\n\n依据：\n- [Diocese of San Jose (Nueva Ecija) – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_(Nueva_Ecija))\n- [UCA News 教区名录：San Jose, Nueva Ecija](https://www.ucanews.com/directory/dioceses/philippines-san-jose-nueva-ecija/407)\n- [Diocese of San Jose de Antique – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_de_Antique)\n- [Catholic-Hierarchy：San Jose de Antique](https://catholic-hierarchy.org/diocese/dsjda.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2585, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5726, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2585}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:47:11.299Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDWkCdxY6EULAxKZfxTq"}
